e you make determines his fate.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998290/9c22ef6c47900e6e1b8898bb0386347af0997f6d/header.jpg?t=1763634721", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998290/0041fbdbad8a50ab193c48e4993bcf18f05aff47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763634721", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998290/0041fbdbad8a50ab193c48e4993bcf18f05aff47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763634721", "website": "https://www.cascha-games.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Window 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core2Duo 2.4Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256M<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> PCM，WAVE</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Window 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 9400F / AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 2GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1024 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> PCM，WAVE</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or Apple silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 GB available space</li></ul>"